{
  "_id": "wp-post-9816",
  "_type": "post",
  "_createdAt": "2026-02-10T06:43:32Z",
  "_updatedAt": "2026-10-16T19:44:01Z",
  "title": "UK Student Visa Process for Nepali Students: Step-by-Step Guide (2026)",
  "slug": {
    "_type": "slug",
    "current": "uk-student-visa-process-for-nepalese-students"
  },
  "publishedAt": "2025-09-17T05:22:56",
  "excerpt": "Studying in the United Kingdom is a dream for many Nepali students. However, before beginning classes at your chosen university, [&hellip;]",
  "content": [
    {
      "_key": "d18c466b87f8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "794a0f45eb62",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Studying in the United Kingdom is a dream for many Nepali students. However, before beginning classes at your chosen university, you must successfully complete the "
        },
        {
          "_key": "2e865fd3f455",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "UK Student Visa process"
        },
        {
          "_key": "2f78a8539ad4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". Although it may seem complex, the application becomes smooth and manageable when you follow the right steps."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "825a1f675d72",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "bf50b2d2e699",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "At "
        },
        {
          "_key": "9cba11a94ed1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Admizz Education"
        },
        {
          "_key": "dc680e723ac2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", we help Nepali students navigate the UK student visa system with ease. In this guide, you will find clear instructions, requirements, and expert tips to ensure a high visa success rate."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "59a6f6ae16f1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0d5486972f52",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Why Choose the UK as Your Study Destination?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "552769786e40",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "8720a7b37ab2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The UK is home to prestigious universities, globally recognized degrees, and outstanding research facilities. Moreover, it provides Nepali students with valuable work opportunities and cultural exposure. Because of these reasons, the UK consistently ranks among the top choices for students from Nepal."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c5759e256115",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f8e92aebb291",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Step-by-Step UK Student Visa Process for Nepali Students"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a837b80db004",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "cef7ef0645de",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Step 1: Receive an Offer Letter from a UK University"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0e6a103ff1b5",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0344ab3a0bee",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Before applying for a visa, you must secure admission to a recognized UK institution. Once accepted, you will receive a "
        },
        {
          "_key": "0589b167c446",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Confirmation of Acceptance for Studies (CAS)"
        },
        {
          "_key": "72e558368dbd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". This letter is crucial because your visa application cannot proceed without it."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f47910d518fe",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "03699502aeb2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Step 2: Prepare the Required Documents"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "1121750c184f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9264e2d662db",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "To ensure a smooth visa process, gather all necessary documents in advance. You will typically need:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "811b835cda66",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "aade07182d3b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A valid passport"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c6e8baff2978",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "574dfe71fddc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "CAS letter from the university"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8fae65a8d9b6",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4673a8cd96d1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Proof of financial ability (bank statements, sponsor letters)"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8c8059cf14c7",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a44eead6c9c6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Academic transcripts and certificates"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "65f207ec1385",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0f84b33bb9d5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "English language test results (IELTS, PTE, or TOEFL)"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4f0d1f0200b9",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "34ccfd7a06f7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Tuberculosis (TB) test certificate (mandatory for Nepali applicants)"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "5e7171b4c737",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "625f09950cc1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Recent passport-size photographs"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a58e55d9e5e3",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "76c1af79f7a2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Because missing documents can cause delays, double-check everything before submission."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d155bff2cc9d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b9eb7cefe5ca",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Step 3: Prove Financial Requirements"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ff188cba46de",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "2f1e4756cdb2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The UK government requires proof that you can cover tuition fees and living expenses. As a Nepali applicant, you must demonstrate:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "bdc9059e73b3",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "8d95f888c672",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Tuition Fees"
        },
        {
          "_key": "198e6ed1cc1a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ": As listed in your CAS."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ddfc8ddda4f7",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "78213cc6e5b1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Living Costs"
        },
        {
          "_key": "7bb3746b23fc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ": At least £1,529 per month in London and £1,171 per month elsewhere in the UK, for up to 9 months (£13,761 or £10,539 in total), for applications made before 30 November 2026. For applications from 30 November 2026, this rises to £1,570 and £1,203 per month (£14,130 or £10,827 in total). (Updated October 2026: fees are subject to change and have recently changed.)"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "1ece768405a6",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7deeb4f35c66",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Funds must be held in your account (or your sponsor’s) for at least "
        },
        {
          "_key": "8417a0a8b6af",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "28 consecutive days"
        },
        {
          "_key": "0ac80b68d3b2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " before applying, and the end of that 28-day period must be within 31 days of your application date."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "243ee88e756f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "2b0437b09b4b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Step 4: Apply Online for the Student Visa"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "88a056298603",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7a0cf284a175",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "You apply for the UK Student visa online on the official GOV.UK website, up to 6 months before your course starts. During the application, you will:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f49701d7f058",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5672f66e6aed",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Fill in your personal and academic details."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "9577ad0e0e83",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "04db35a5f0c3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Upload required documents."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8af339811222",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "2b547b1fe52e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Pay the visa application fee (£558)."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f4115821e25c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "944f56ecc942",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Pay the Immigration Health Surcharge (IHS) for access to UK healthcare."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "47bb13031e54",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "cfaa2ac827b5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Because accuracy is vital, ensure that all information matches your documents."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ca96114334fd",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "038ede9b31a6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Step 5: Attend the Visa Biometrics Appointment"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ade0a306cea3",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9e06188c6795",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "After submitting your application, you must book a biometrics appointment at the "
        },
        {
          "_key": "2e56cc9bc7c2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Visa Application Centre in Kathmandu"
        },
        {
          "_key": "d123f6071bbc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". During this appointment, officials will take your fingerprints and photograph."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "838fa6b10dd8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e9e94731b905",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Step 6: Wait for Visa Decision"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "72f6853e937f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b8143190299e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Once biometrics are completed, your application will be processed. A decision usually takes "
        },
        {
          "_key": "f1b9387bbd9c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "about 3 weeks"
        },
        {
          "_key": "6a54645a4241",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " when you apply from Nepal. If approved, you will receive an "
        },
        {
          "_key": "32dc8441441a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "eVisa"
        },
        {
          "_key": "87e1666d0985",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", a digital record of your immigration status that you access through your UKVI account, instead of a physical BRP card."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a1c0e7d2f301",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a1c0e7d2f302",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Additional Documents You May Need"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a1c0e7d2f303",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a1c0e7d2f304",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Sponsor letter, if your parents or guardian are funding your studies"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a1c0e7d2f305",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a1c0e7d2f306",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Relationship proof (such as a birth certificate) when funds are in a parent's account"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a1c0e7d2f307",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a1c0e7d2f308",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Scholarship letter, if applicable"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a1c0e7d2f309",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a1c0e7d2f30a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "ATAS certificate for certain science, engineering and research courses"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a1c0e7d2f30b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a1c0e7d2f30c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "CV and work experience letters, if you have a study gap"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a1c0e7d2f30d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a1c0e7d2f30e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Make sure your name, date of birth and passport details match exactly across all documents. Even small mismatches can cause delays."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a1c0e7d2f30f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a1c0e7d2f310",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Bank Statement Rules for Proof of Funds"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a1c0e7d2f311",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a1c0e7d2f312",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Accepted sources: your own account, a parent or guardian's account, an education loan from a recognized institution, or an official scholarship or sponsorship"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a1c0e7d2f313",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a1c0e7d2f314",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Funds must stay above the required amount for 28 consecutive days"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a1c0e7d2f315",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a1c0e7d2f316",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The statement must show the bank's name and logo, the account holder's name, the statement period and the closing balance"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a1c0e7d2f317",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a1c0e7d2f318",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Show first-year tuition fees (minus any deposit already paid) plus living costs"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a1c0e7d2f319",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a1c0e7d2f31a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Your eVisa and UKVI Account"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a1c0e7d2f31b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a1c0e7d2f31c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The UK now issues student visas as eVisas. After approval you should:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a1c0e7d2f31d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a1c0e7d2f31e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Create a UKVI account linked to the passport you will travel with"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a1c0e7d2f31f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a1c0e7d2f320",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Keep your login details safe and your contact details up to date"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a1c0e7d2f321",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a1c0e7d2f322",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Update your eVisa account if you get a new passport"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a1c0e7d2f323",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a1c0e7d2f324",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Recommended UK Visa Timeline"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
