      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "b7f3f167c0e5",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c28eb4327829",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "1. How long does it take to get a UK student visa from Nepal?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ea7d5bf32ad5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "baf4af42d87e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Usually about 3 weeks when applying from outside the UK. Priority services are available for a faster decision at extra cost."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "9c6f1944073d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "aca8bf0fd931",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "2. Can I work on a UK student visa?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "4daf230794e6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "79ba84a2cbff",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Yes, Nepali students can work 20 hours per week during term time and full-time during holidays."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "02916a53eb56",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "942cac90c82a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "3. What is the visa success rate for Nepali students?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "50919459d681",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "086e39481dc0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The success rate is high when documents are correct and financial requirements are met."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e7e64a369668",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "15cf713eab3c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "4. Do I need IELTS for a UK student visa?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "cc3a7d1286d4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ff8569db1aab",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Most universities require IELTS or equivalent, but some may accept MOI (Medium of Instruction) proof."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ebf49be90b9e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b8d61c8c69fd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "5. Can my dependents join me on a student visa?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "6b2a35038516",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "18fdefa8c3d3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Only in limited cases. For courses starting from January 2024, students on taught master's courses cannot bring dependants. Dependants are mainly allowed for PhD or research-based postgraduate degrees and for government-sponsored students."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
